SUMMARY:The Weight
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Times: 12:30pm\, 2:55pm\, 5:20pm\, 7:45pm\nWhen Samuel (Hawke) 
 is torn from his daughter and sent to a brutal prison\, Warden Clancy (Cro
 we) offers a high-stakes proposition: smuggle gold out of a remote mine wi
 th a dangerous crew of prisoners and he’ll win his freedom. But as the g
 roup journeys into the unforgiving wilderness\, the real threat isn’t th
 e terrain - it’s the betrayal and violence festering within their ranks.
  Surrounded by greed\, suspicion\, and danger\, Samuel must risk everythin
 g to reunite with his child.\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/the-w
 eight\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/the-weight
