SUMMARY:Coyote vs. Acme
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Times: 12:45pm\, 5pm\, 7:30pm\nAfter decades of being blown to 
 bits by bombs\, demolished by dynamite\, mangled by magnets\, battered by 
 boulders\, trampled by trains\, tricked by tunnels\, sprung by springs\, s
 teamrolled by steamrollers\, maligned by misfires\, bedeviled by bungees\,
  rattled by rockets\, backstabbed by bat suits\, rocked by rocket skates\,
  upended by unicycles\, quaked by quake pills\, rubberized by rogue bands\
 , and hurled headlong off every cliff in the Southwest\, Wile E. Coyote (G
 enius) finally fights back. Teaming up with billboard accident lawyer Kevi
 n Avery (Will Forte)\, he takes on slick corporate counsel Buddy Crane (Jo
 hn Cena) and ACME\, Inc.\, the profit-obsessed conglomerate behind every o
 ne of the Coyote’s chaotic catastrophes.\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.c
 om/movie/coyote-vs-acme\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/coyote-vs-acme
