UID:79a7b0fad05568d9c76cbe566e11acf766169cc2@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20260919T013100Z
DTSTART:20260920T171000Z
DTEND:20260920T191000Z
SUMMARY:Filipiñana
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Times: 1:10pm\, 3:20pm\, 5:30pm\, 7:40pm\nAmid stifling heat an
 d pervasive drought\, Isabel (Jorrybell Agoto)\, a 17-year-old Ilokana fro
 m the rural north\, works at a posh country club outside Manila\, lining u
 p golf balls for powerful men to drive into the verdant horizon. New to th
 e job\, she wanders the immaculate grounds sampling its luxuries as member
 s\, including an industrialist and his expatriate niece\, the club preside
 nt and his pampered wife\, and a slew of Chinese tourists\, engage in a co
 mplex dance with the club’s doting and subservient staff. But something 
 is rotting beneath the pristine fairways of the elite resort\, as Isabel d
 iscovers when she tries to return a mislaid golf club to its patriarchal d
 irector\, Dr. Palanca (Teroy Guzman). The deeper she journeys into its mos
 t exclusive corners\, the closer she gets to the violent truths of the clu
 b\, her native Philippines\, and her own past..\nhttps://www.westnewtoncin
 ema.com/movie/filipiana\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/filipiana
END:VEVENT
