BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:5e7a7da607c0dbbfd26b2858e189f8d21b53bc65@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20260919T013100Z
DTSTART:20260921T213000Z
DTEND:20260921T233000Z
SUMMARY:Filipiñana
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Times: 5:30pm\, 7:40pm\nAmid stifling heat and pervasive drough
 t\, Isabel (Jorrybell Agoto)\, a 17-year-old Ilokana from the rural north\
 , works at a posh country club outside Manila\, lining up golf balls for p
 owerful men to drive into the verdant horizon. New to the job\, she wander
 s the immaculate grounds sampling its luxuries as members\, including an i
 ndustrialist and his expatriate niece\, the club president and his pampere
 d wife\, and a slew of Chinese tourists\, engage in a complex dance with t
 he club’s doting and subservient staff. But something is rotting beneath
  the pristine fairways of the elite resort\, as Isabel discovers when she 
 tries to return a mislaid golf club to its patriarchal director\, Dr. Pala
 nca (Teroy Guzman). The deeper she journeys into its most exclusive corner
 s\, the closer she gets to the violent truths of the club\, her native Phi
 lippines\, and her own past..\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/fili
 piana\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/filipiana
END:VEVENT
