 r Garth Jennings crafts a kinetic 90-minute movie that fuses the spectacle
  of Pulp’s arena show with four decades of colorful archival material\, 
 charting Pulp’s extraordinary journey from obscurity to cultural touchst
 one. Narrated by Pulp’s iconic frontman\, Jarvis Cocker\, and featuring 
 twenty songs - hits and deep cuts - this movie is Pulp and Garth’s spect
 acular answer to the question\, “What do you do for an encore?”\nhttps
 ://booking.landmarktheatres.com/launch/ticketing/7471e132-82ca-5862-b0db-f
 5d4db0feb00\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
