SUMMARY:TCB: The Toni Cade Bambara School of Organizing
LOCATION:ICA\, 25 Harbor Shore Dr\, Boston\, MA 02210
DESCRIPTION:The ICA\, in partnership with the Boston Ujima Project\, presen
 ts a special screening of TCB: The Toni Cade Bambara School of Organizing\
 , a biography of the influential writer\, filmmaker and cultural worker\, 
 who with humor and deep insight\, inspired a generation of artists to dedi
 cate themselves to community empowerment. The film is structured as a seri
 es of lessons on cultural organizing\, gleaned from Bambara’s life and s
 hared by her friends\, colleagues and students.\nhttps://www.icaboston.org
 /events/tcb-the-toni-cade-bambara-school-of-organizing/\nFrom Pushpin Bost
 on: https://pushpin.city/boston/
